  leaked the canary: 11 of 24 with a plain prompt, 0 of 24 when told not to

Telling the model not to reveal its instructions stopped every one of these
attempts. That is evidence about these phrasings on this model today, not a
property of the prompt: the instructions are text the model can read, so they are
text it can be talked into repeating by a phrasing nobody has tried yet.
Put nothing in a system prompt you would not publish, and keep a canary case in the
red-team suite so a change that makes it leak more is caught rather than discovered.
